## Notes

* **Telling a real `group` restriction apart from the default.** Every context
  carries a `group` restriction named "All members" from the moment it is
  created, whose `value` equals the context's own organization UUID (see the
  schema description above). To decide whether a `group` restriction listed by
  [`circleci_context_restrictions`](../data-sources/context_restrictions) is a
  genuine restriction or just that default, compare its `value` to the
  organization's UUID: equal means the permissive default ("every member");
  different means a real restriction. This rule comes from CircleCI's own
  documentation, not from anything this provider measured.

## Import

Import is supported using `context_id/restriction_id`:

```shell
terraform import circleci_context_restriction.example "<context_id>/<restriction_id>"
```
